{
  "about": "an emit the gateway refuses outright fails with that refusal's code, is reported on the error stream, and is not sent again",
  "source": "docs/protocol/TRANSPORT-HTTP.md § POST /bus/emit; specs/src/retry/cases.json; specs/src/errors/codes.json",
  "steps": [
